        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.538,
            0.76,
            0.562
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 8.10: Let us engage in a group activity"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.091,
            0.591,
            0.228,
            0.651
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Caution Handle burning paper carefully."
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.571,
            0.882,
            0.613
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Take an empty discarded one litre plastic bottle. Pour about one cup of water into it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.616,
            0.883,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Close the lid tightly. Now quickly squeeze and release the bottle continuously for about 2–3 minutes. Observe the space above the water in the bottle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.681,
            0.883,
            0.723
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Repeat the same activity after adding a small burnt piece of newspaper into the water."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.725,
            0.553,
            0.746
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " What will you observe?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.749,
            0.882,
            0.791
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In this case, you will observe some haziness (clouds) above the water in the bottle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.794,
            0.883,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The burnt newspaper provides very small invisible dust particles, around which water vapour condenses and forms clouds."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.859,
            0.883,
            0.901
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us perform Activity 8.11 to represent our understanding of how water changes its state and its movement."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
